@startuml
!theme plain

title test-workflow — 通用测试验证梯度
hide footbox

actor "开发者 / Codex" as author
participant "需求 / Slice" as requirement
participant "test-workflow\n测试编排" as workflow
participant "静态检查\n类型 / Lint / Schema" as static
participant "Focused tests\n单元 / 组件 / API" as focused
participant "Integration /\nAffected regression" as integration
participant "Browser / E2E\n按需启用" as browser
participant "证据与\nMarkdown 报告" as report

author -> requirement : 提供需求、验收标准、实际改动
requirement -> workflow : 提炼验收点与测试清单

alt 复杂 / 高风险行为
  workflow -> focused : RED：确认缺失行为
  focused --> workflow : 失败原因或已有行为
else 微小 / 普通变更
  workflow -> workflow : 选择最小相关检查
end

workflow -> static : 运行静态检查
static --> workflow : 通过 / 失败证据
alt 静态检查失败
  workflow -> workflow : 分类失败并停止扩大范围
else 静态检查通过
  workflow -> focused : 运行 focused tests
  focused --> workflow : 通过 / 失败证据
  alt focused tests 失败
    workflow -> workflow : 分类根因并按需处理
    workflow -> static : 修复后重跑相关检查
    static --> workflow : 新证据
    workflow -> focused : 复测原失败点
  else focused tests 通过
    workflow -> integration : 运行受影响的集成 / 回归
    integration --> workflow : 通过 / 失败证据
  end
end

opt 浏览器可见行为或明确要求 E2E
  workflow -> browser : 从已知状态执行最小用户流程
  browser --> workflow : 页面状态与失败证据
end

workflow -> report : 汇总验收覆盖、实际结果与证据
report --> author : pass / partial / fail / blocked

note over workflow
  优先最低成本、可靠的测试层
  不用放宽断言、盲目重试或固定 sleep 制造通过
end note
@enduml
